	(text_box "OUTPUT RAILS (all from MUX2_OUT = 5.4 - 6.5 V)\n\n+5V_ADC - LT3042 (U1) -> ADS1299 AVDD only\n  5.00 V +/-2 % | max 200 mA | load ~10 mA (est.)\n  0.8 uVrms, PSRR 79 dB @ 1 MHz | needs VIN > 5.35 V\n  PG high above 4.71 V -> enables +5V_UGA\n\n+5V_UGA - TPS7A4901 (IC3) -> active electrode buffers\n  5.01 V +/-2.5 % | max 150 mA | load ~10 - 20 mA (est.)\n  15 uVrms | dropout 260 mV @ 100 mA -> VIN > 5.3 V\n  EN = PG_LDO_ADC: starts only once +5V_ADC is up\n\n+3V3_MCU/RF - TPS629210 buck (IC4)\n  -> STM32WBA65, ADS1299 DVDD, status LEDs, mux ST pull-ups\n  3.31 V +/-1.5 % | max 1 A | load ~20 - 40 mA peak (RF TX)\n  VIN 3 - 17 V | up to 2.5 MHz, auto PFM (MODE = GND)\n\nTest points: TP1/TP4 +5V_ADC, TP3 +5V_UGA, TP2 +3V3_MCU/RF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 222.25 156.21 0)
		(size 99.06 38.707)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7398046a-836d-40b3-a81d-1fa39a8c0f10")
	)
	(text_box "INPUT LIMITS\nJ3 ALIM (bench supply, DEBUG ONLY)\n  V: 5.5 - 6.5 V (nom 6.0 V). max = SMAJ6.5A VWM\n  Used instead of USB while V_ALIM > 0.89 x V_USB6 (~5.36 V)\n  I: < F1 hold current (PTC, TBD ~500 mA), mux ILIM 1.5 A\nJ2 POWER BOARD (battery, main supply)\n  V: 5.7 - 6.3 V nom / 5.4 - 6.5 V abs\n  (min 5.4 V = LT3042 5.0 V + 0.35 V dropout, max = TVS VWM)\n  I: < F2 hold current (TBD). Check S3 EG1218 contact rating\nJ4 USB-C (sink only, Rd = 5k1, no PD)\n  VBUS: 4.75 - 5.5 V, I < 500 mA (default USB power)\n  +6V_USB boost: Iout < ~0.35 A (500 mA x 5 V x 85 % / 6 V)\nBoard load (est.): ~50 mA @ 6 V typ, < 150 mA peak"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.875 251.46 0)
		(size 74.93 31.75)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
