	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES\nStart-up sequence\n 1. MUX2_OUT up -> LT3042 fast start-up\n    (PGFB < 0.3 V: SET current ~2 mA)\n 2. +5V_ADC > 4.71 V (~12 ms): PG releases,\n    IC3 EN pulled high by R37\n 3. +5V_UGA soft-starts (C9 NR/SS 10 nF)\n -> buffers never drive an unpowered ADS1299\n Firmware: wait > 200 ms before ADS1299 setup\n\nNoise\n - ADC and UGA rails: own LDOs, not shared\n   with MCU/RF loads\n - FB1 + C7/C60 keep buck input pulses off\n   MUX2_OUT (shared with both LDO inputs)\n - CSET 4u7: reference noise filtered above\n   0.68 Hz (below the EEG band)\n\nLayout\n - BOOST_SW / BUCK_SW loops small, far from\n   the AFE and electrode connectors\n - LT3042 OUTS: Kelvin trace to C2 / load\n - C1/C2, C6/C10, C7/C11 < 2 mm from pins\n - One solid GND plane (TI ADS1299 guide)\n\nSafety\n - ALIM and USB from a mains PC are NOT\n   isolated: debug only\n - Record on a subject from the Power Board\n   (battery) only"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 332.74 59.69 0)
		(size 72.39 66.04)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ccd80831-7b1e-44a0-ada8-8ecae8da8236")
	)
	(text_box "+3V3_MCU/RF - digital supply (TPS629210)"
